A project designed with the needs of modern life in mind, with 8 units, divided into 4 floors, all with balconies and garage, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, close to various services and access roads.



It is divided as follows:

- Large living room and equipped kitchen with access to a balcony, overlooking the river and the city;

- 2 suites with built-in wardrobes;

- 1 bedroom with built-in wardrobe;

- Technical area on the balcony.



The covered area will be a social space, duly prepared for this purpose, with a jacuzzi and shading pergola.



Some details about the finishing map:

- Heat pumps;

- Aluminum with thermal break;

- Air conditioning in bedrooms and living room;

- White lacquered doors and internal wardrobes;

- Wardrobe with built-in light;

- Stainless steel handles;

- All plastered and painted surfaces;

- Multilayer water circulation pipes;

- Telephone terminals in the bedrooms, living room and hall and TV terminals in all rooms except the bathrooms;

- Video intercom;

- Electric underfloor heating in the bathrooms;

- Aluminum blinds with polyethane inside, operated by an electric motor;

- Facade in exposed brick in brown and plaster painted in white, dark grey thermally cut aluminium frame and tempered/laminated glass railing.



Delivery deadline: Q1 2027



